# JobBeagle — Core Stack Facts

- **Product**: US-market AI job triage / headhunter-level JD analysis SaaS.
- **Stack**: Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, TypeScript 5, Tailwind.
- **Backend**: Supabase (Postgres + Auth Google OAuth + Storage + RLS).
- **AI**: Gemini via `@google/genai` — Snapshot `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`; Guide single-pass `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` (+ Search, no Lite pre-pass). Models in `constants/models.ts`.
- **Payments**: **Lemon Squeezy only**. Never call Stripe / `lib/stripe.ts` (dead code — remove when touching billing).
- **Extension**: Chrome MV3 under `browser-extension/` (v1.3.0+). Boards: LinkedIn, Indeed, ZipRecruiter, Glassdoor, GovernmentJobs, 104.
- **Domain**: https://www.jobbeagle.com
- **Credits**: Free = 3 lifetime Lite (`constants/credits.ts`); Full starts at 0. Plans in `constants/checkout-plans.ts`.
- **Env secrets**: Never expose `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`, `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `LEMONSQUEEZY_*` secrets to client. Only `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` in browser.
- **Docs**: `PRODUCT_OVERVIEW.md`, `ENTERPRISE_ARCHITECTURE.md`
